rors. Validate early error/rejection, cycle/depth/string/event limits and the real-browser negative gate control. Standalone Windows portable-runner batches derive from complete inventory and remain at most 20 scenarios; run actual hosted Windows full shards to establish timing and acceptance. See docs/testing-feedback-loop.md."
